message: "If you reference this software in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: CoinGlimpse
type: software
abstract: >-
  CoinGlimpse is an ASP.NET Core API for retrieving supported cryptocurrency
  coins and their current USD market data from CoinGecko. It provides coin-list
  and coin-detail endpoints through a custom HTTP client integration.
authors:
  - family-names: Zebrowski
    given-names: Marek
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - CoinGecko
  - ASP.NET Core
  - market data
repository-code: https://github.com/ZebrowskiM/StockGenie
